@startuml
title Expense Submission and Approval Sequence (proposed)
actor Submitter
participant "Client (Swing or web/mobile)" as Client
participant "Expense service" as Service
participant "Group / policy" as Policy
database "Transactional records" as DB
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as Outbox
participant "Notification channel" as Notify
Submitter -> Client : submit expense + idempotency key
Client -> Service : command
Service -> Policy : authorize; resolve members/policy
Policy --> Service : authorized + policy snapshot
Service -> Service : validate and calculate exact shares
Service -> DB : transaction: expense + shares + policy + outbox
DB --> Service : committed pending expense
Service --> Client : pending status (no balance change)
Outbox -> DB : read committed notice intent
Outbox -> Notify : deliver with dedupe identity
Notify --> Outbox : delivery outcome
note over Service,DB
Final approval decision and expense ledger posting must commit
in one transaction. Retries cannot post twice.
end note
@enduml
